diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index 4fdb98e..92462b1 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@

 ## Unreleased

+- Report a 650 ms DOWN hold to PassVoice as a BLE V1 button event, including a hold immediately following a tap. Each press reports at most one gesture. Other hosts still receive only DOWN clicks.
+
 - Let PassVoice opt in to an UP-only capture policy. Ignore DOWN and OK during capture, including a press released after the stop, and report a fresh press immediately after UP with the stopped session ID if its end notification is still pending. Other hosts keep their existing button behavior.

 - Validate the CW2017 cell voltage before accepting the first charge reading. When the gauge reports 0% with an invalid voltage, show an unavailable reading until the gauge recovers.
